// A program still outside the native backend's subset: a function with a
// heap-wrapper (`Shared[T]`) parameter, which awaits ADR-0028 Stage C. It
// type-checks (the type exists), so `tuo build` must *refuse* it cleanly —
// never mis-compile it — pointing back to the interpreter. Since ADR-0009
// Stage B the owned `String` and growable `Array[Int]` are lowered, and since
// ADR-0028 Stage B `Box[T]` is too, so only `Shared`/`Weak` remain.
fn keep(take b: Shared[Int]) -> Int { 0 }
fn main() -> Int { 7 }
